00:07:03.206 --> 00:07:07.386
The milestone confirms the mechanical systems needed to point the completed telescope.

00:07:08.354 --> 00:07:13.434
Europe's upcoming ice mission, Crystal, completed solar array integration and entered qualification

00:07:13.434 --> 00:07:14.034
