00:07:14.034 --> 00:07:17.514
The European Space Agency, or ESA, reported.

00:07:18.294 --> 00:07:22.614
The arrays will power instruments designed to track changes in Earth ice sheets from orbit.

00:07:23.094 --> 00:07:26.654
